E health_14;elena;prompt;en                                                     
M Emotional Freedom Technique (EFT)                                             
U Stress Management                                                             
X 1. Think of an issue that's bothering you. This could be any issue. For       
X+ example, it could be something you're feeling anxious or sad about.          
X 2. Measure how your issue makes you feel. Rate how bad you feel on a scale    
X+ from 0 to                                                                    
X 10. A score of 0 means you don't feel bad at all. But a score of 10 means you 
X+ feel as bad as possible. Write down this number.                             
X 3. Create a statement that describes your issue, followed by a statement of   
X+ self-acceptance. For example, you could say, "Even though I feel anxious     
X+ about work tomorrow, I deeply and completely accept myself." Or you could    
X+ say, "Even though my partner broke up with me, I deeply and completely accept
X+ myself."                                                                     
X 4. Tap repeatedly on the edge of your palm, below your little finger. While   
X+ you tap, say your statement out loud 3 times.                                
X 5. Now tap on the rest of the points on your body, one at a time. While you   
X+ tap, state your issue over and over. For example, you might repeat "anxious  
X+ about test" or "we broke up." Tap on each point in this order. Tap on the    
X+ top, center of your head. Tap on the inside edge of one eyebrow. Tap next to 
X+ the outside edge of one eye. Tap on the bone underneath one eye. Tap between 
X+ your nose and your upper lip. Tap between your lower lip and your chin. Tap  
X+ beneath one collarbone (find the notch beneath the inside edge of the        
X+ collarbone). Tap under one armpit (about 4 inches below the armpit).         
X 6. Stop and remeasure how you feel about your issue.                          
X 7. Repeat the steps if needed. Tap until you can give your issue a lower      
X+ number, or until you feel better.                                            
